# Kivi requires NO environment variables.
#
# There are no API keys, no secrets, and no network access at any point:
#   - the ASR provider is a deterministic echo stub
#   - the semantic layer runs a vendored local embedding model
#     (backend/kivi/models/potion-base-8M) - no service call, $0
#
# This file exists only to document that fact, as the task asks.
#
# Every tunable lives in config.json (thresholds, confidence, personal_phonetics,
# semantic_context). See RUN.md section 10.
